{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — Ingredient Education (Section 9)
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-ingredients-section" id="ingredients" style="padding: 80px 0; background: var(--zvhc-ivory);">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    <div class="zvhc-section-header" style="text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 52px;">
      <div class="zvhc-eyebrow" style="color: var(--zvhc-orange); font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">WHAT WE PUT IN (AND LEAVE OUT)</div>
      <h2 class="zvhc-heading-md" style="color: var(--zvhc-forest); font-family: var(--zvhc-font-heading); font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 14px;">Pure Botanical Integrity</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--zvhc-forest); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.5; opacity: 0.85;">Formulated with high-potency, cold-pressed plant lipids and clean bioactive nutrients. Zero cheap fillers, silicones, or sulfates.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="zvhc-ingredients-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;">
      <!-- Ingredient 1 -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 18px; padding: 28px; border: 2px solid rgba(1,93,71,0.08); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; background: rgba(1,93,71,0.1); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.4rem;">🌿</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-forest); font-size: 1.15rem;">Raw Honduran Batana Oil</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--zvhc-orange); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Elaeis Oleifera</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #555; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">Rich in oleic and linoleic essential fatty acids (Omega-6 and 9) that penetrate deeply into hair follicles to restore moisture balance and reinforce cuticle tensile strength.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Ingredient 2 -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 18px; padding: 28px; border: 2px solid rgba(1,93,71,0.08); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; background: rgba(224,243,84,0.3); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.4rem;">🧬</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-forest); font-size: 1.15rem;">Hydrolyzed Keratin Protein</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--zvhc-orange); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Structural Amino Acids</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #555; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">Micro-fine plant-derived keratin fibers carry a natural electrostatic charge, bonding instantly with fine human hair fibers to create seamless visual thickness and density.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Ingredient 3 -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 18px; padding: 28px; border: 2px solid rgba(1,93,71,0.08); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; background: rgba(253,85,10,0.1); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.4rem;">💧</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-forest); font-size: 1.15rem;">Cold-Pressed Castor &amp; Argan</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--zvhc-orange); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Ricinoleic Acid &amp; Vitamin E</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #555; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">Castor oil provides intense moisture cushioning for delicate hairline edges, while Moroccan Argan adds reflective high-gloss shine without weighing curls down.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Clean Standards Strip -->
    <div style="margin-top: 48px; background: var(--zvhc-forest); color: #FFF; border-radius: 18px; padding: 24px 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-around; align-items: center; gap: 20px; text-align: center;">
      <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--zvhc-lime);">🌿 100% VEGAN &amp; CLEAN</div>
      <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #FFF;">🐰 CRUELTY-FREE</div>
      <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--zvhc-lime);">🚫 NO PARABENS OR SULFATES</div>
      <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #FFF;">🧪 DERMATOLOGICALLY TESTED</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ZVHC Ingredient Education",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
